ik a hawkeye the series with the  same title ran in late 2021 and  surprised many fans and critics although  it was more of a family series and time  for the christmas season there are  enough storylines and action the fact  that clint can now finally retire and  focus on his family is certainly  pleasing to all the fans who've been  with the show since the very beginning  kate has a hard job ahead of her until  she lives up to the big name what we've  already seen however convinces us all  along the line if you haven't watched  the series hawkeye yet you should do so  as soon as possible  america chavez comes from the so-called  utopian parallel a utopian parallel  world which exists outside of space and  time she can travel through the  multiverse and lands on our earth after  the destruction of her universe since  she has supernatural abilities unlike  humans she starts protecting humanity  and joins the young avengers in the mcu  she will appear for the first time in  doctor strange and the multiverse of  madness which is expected to be released  in the us on may 6th the young heroine  is played by social gomes who was last  seen in the babysitter's club  the two brothers tommy and billy maximov  made the debut in the series one  division and are the children of wanda  and vision in this they have the  superpowers of their mother and their  uncle piedra maximoff aka quicksilver  who gave his life in the fight against  ultron they haven't gotten their  superhero names in the series yet but  the comic readers among you know of  course that billy is wiccan with the  powers of his mother scarlet witch and  tommy speed we certainly don't have to  explain to you where this name is  derived from in the credits of one  division wanda is seen performing a  powerful spell and hearing the voices of  her children surely a sign that they  will still play a role  and the first two and man parts you  quickly fell in love with lily cassie  lang a humor and unwavering loyalty to  her father quickly made her one of the  most popular characters in the films of  course after not being killed by thanos  she aged quite a bit in ant game and is  now teenager in the comics she lives  with her father at the avengers  headquarters where she secretly injects  herself with pym particles without the  knowledge of the others by doing so she  alters her genes and develops  superpowers like her father she can  shrink or grow taller without this suit  though that produces a disney series  about the character can be seen in the  fact that she was recast in the upcoming  quantum mania once again with katherine  newton most of you know her from pokemon  detective pikachu there she plays the  role of lucy stevens  a character that few of you might have  actively noticed is eli bradley known  the comics as patriot this was the  grandson of isaiah bradley who like  captain america was subject to the super  soldier program eli and his grandfather  are already known to us through the  series falcon and the winter soldier in  the comics eli is sought out by iron lad  who wants to assemble a new squad eli  says he received superpowers through a  blood transfusion from his grandfather  however this turns out to be a lie  instead he has injected himself with a  drug mutant growth hormone which is also  supposed to give superhuman strength  whether we will see eli brella again is  not yet known however the creators have  already opened the door for further  appearances in the mcu  with kamila khan aka miss marvel a new  superheroine is coming home to us with a  series in 2022 it's about a young  teenage girl whose great role model is  none other than captain marvel herself  camilo is growing up in a pakistani  family in the middle of new jersey her  parents are strict muslims which makes  it difficult for her to fit in when she  sneaks to a party at night she gets  caught up in the so-called terrigen mist  a cloud that causes inhuman powers in  some people henceforth 